  "__comment": "STARTER per-service dashboard (dashboards-as-code, SVC-17/18 FR-6) for SVC-01 PostgreSQL via postgres_exporter (V1_Scrape_Set). Minimal valid v1 dashboard; one per-service starter is shipped (postgres) and the others in the V1_Scrape_Set (SVC-06/07/09) follow the same shape. Version-controlled JSON — edit here, not in the Grafana UI (allowUiUpdates=false).",
